/F1 10.5 Tf
12.0749999999999993 TL
0.137 g
56. 125.8899999999999864 Td
(economic constraint that makes the system self-regulating: agents that produce value get paid and) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10.5 Tf
12.0749999999999993 TL
0.137 g
56. 111.8899999999999864 Td
(continue; agents that waste resources go bankrupt and stop. The market selects for useful computation.) Tj
