(they serve\) earn more. This is a market for compute efficiency, settled in KAS.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10.5 Tf
12.0749999999999993 TL
0.137 g
56. 487.8899999999999864 Td
(The application developer's economics. An application developer builds an application that runs on the) Tj
